     "body": "<p>This looks good, and it works as advertised when using the webapp.<br/>\nHowever, when trying to deploy in karaf, the following error is thrown:</p>\n\n<p>&gt; feature:repo-add mvn:org.fcrepo.camel/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/LATEST/xml/features<br/>\n&gt; feature:install fcrepo-fixity</p>\n\n<p>Caused by: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: javax.naming.InvalidNameException not found by org.apache.httpcomponents.httpclient <span class=\"error\">&#91;119&#93;</span></p>",
